  "description": "Bring the vibrant flavours of a Mediterranean holiday right to your dinner table with these golden spinach falafels. Piled onto warm flatbread with tangy pickled cabbage, salty olives and creamy fetta, every mouthful is a perfect balance of crunch, zest and rich umami goodness. A dollop of cooling, herb-packed dill-yoghurt sauce brings it all together for a fresh, effortless feast that’s pure joy to eat.",
