  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Add shredded cabbage mix to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover cabbage. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-f5afd400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice cucumber into thin rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-63b1e510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Set your air fryer to 200°C.\n• Place spinach falafel in air fryer basket. Lightly coat or spray with olive oil and bake until golden and heated through, 5-7 minutes.\n• TIP: No air fryer? Halve spinach falafel. In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium high heat. When oil is hot, cook falafels, turning halfway, until golden brown, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-613fcb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the falafel is baking, in a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, dill & parsley mayonnaise and a generous squeeze of lemon juice.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-e5ea1f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave flatbreads on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Slice flatbreads into quarters.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-51a15040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled cabbage.\n• Divide spinach falafel, flatbreads, pickled cabbage, tomatoes, cucumber rounds, Kalamata olives, dill-yoghurt sauce and fetta cubes between plates.\n• Drizzle olive oil over tomatoes and cucumber.\n• Season to taste.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-804b5a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
